{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19946","headline":"石淙 十 · 孟郊","name":"石淙 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣朝搜岩谷，此地多遗玩。\n怠惰成远游，顽疎恣灵观。\n劲飙刷幽视，怒水慑余愞。\n曾是结芳诚，远兹勉流倦。\n冰条耸危虑，霜翠莹遐眄。\n物诱信多端，荒寻谅难遍。\n去矣朔之隅，翛然楚之甸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19946.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19946","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}